############################################################
# User API Test (#33)
# - GET /users/me
# - PATCH /users/me
# - DELETE /users/me
# - GET /users/me/settings
# - PATCH /users/me/settings
############################################################

### 1) 내 프로필 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2) 내 프로필 수정 (displayName, avatarUrl)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "displayName": "할롤로",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### 3) 내 프로필 수정 (avatarUrl 제거)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "avatarUrl": null
}


### 4) 내 설정 조회 (없으면 기본값 생성)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5) 내 설정 수정 (theme + language)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "theme": "DARK",
  "language": "en"
}

### 6) 내 설정 부분 수정 (theme만)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "theme": "LIGHT"
}

### 7) 회원 탈퇴
# 주의: 팀 워크스페이스 OWNER 상태면 400(BAD_REQUEST)로 차단됨
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
